OL,3,APoundland gets more time to secure a
OL,4,Arescue deal as emergency talks continue
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoundland has avoided immediate
OL,7,Fcollapse after a deadline was extended
OL,8,Fto find a rescue deal.
OL,10,FA deadline to secure a buyer for the
OL,11,Fretail chain was set to expire at
OL,12,Fmidnight, but a court has given
OL,13,FPoundland an extra 10 days to find a
OL,14,Fbuyer.
OL,16,FThe discount chain, which has 11,000
OL,17,Femployees, has been edging towards
OL,18,Fadministration after being blocked by
OL,19,Fowners Gordon Brothers from accessing
OL,20,Fcash in its bank accounts.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,113,105,200,300,0,100
